  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You can call upon the mummified dead of the ancients.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Bind the Ancient Dead<sup>GCC</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You can apply the mummified zombie template (Gothic Campaign Compendium p. 121) to any creature made of flesh and bone that you call or summon. When you apply it to an animal, magical beast, or humanoid, add one-half your mythic tier (minimum 1) to the mummified zombie’s DR and as a bonus on its saving throws.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-general-a-f-feats#toc32\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
